# Feature Name: Item Identification (SKU Management)

## Short Description
A system to create and manage unique SKU codes for every product to easily identify items in the store.

## Purpose
To ensure each item has a unique identity, prevent duplicate entries, and make searching and tracking items faster and more accurate.

## Main Functions / Activities
- Auto-generate unique SKU code for new items
- Validate SKU to avoid duplicates
- Search item using SKU code
- Link SKU to item name, category, and location
- Print barcode/QR code using SKU for labeling